  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "Rinse the chicken and pat dry with paper towels.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the Arabian Spice Blend, olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Rub the spice mixture all over the chicken, making sure to get some under the skin as well.",
    "Place the chicken in a roasting pan and put it in the oven.",
